                "\n",
                "It's board week, and the numbers just turned. Operating expense tracked the plan all spring, then crossed above budget over the summer \u2014 and the **projection to year-end shows the gap widening to a ~$4.8M miss.** Net patient revenue, meanwhile, is essentially flat year over year. So this isn't a demand story \u2014 **it's a cost story.** The map below shows *where* the money is leaking; the next page shows *why*."
              ]
